  "notes": "Peak monthly inflation 129% in August 1922 (Hanke & Krus); prices were then 14,000 times their pre-war level. A League of Nations loan (Oct 1922) stabilised the krone at 14,400 paper kronen per gold krone; the schilling (10,000 kronen) followed. Approximate series, kept for its shape; individual points are not sourced one by one."
